! Ciottoli, Malpica Galassi, Lapenna, Leccese, Bianchi, Nasuti, Creta, Valorani
! Released: Jun 2017
!
! Simplified chemical kinetics mechanisms for hybrid rocket applications 
! using gaseous oxygen (GOX) and hydroxyl-terminated polybutadiene (HTPB)
!
